      "content": "<|channel>thought\n<channel|>Wait, what? You're saying we have critical flaws in the core transaction layer? That sounds massive. My understanding from the last quarterly check was that the auth systems were solid. \n\nAre we talking about a fundamental flaw in our authentication protocols or something else? If this is going to blow up my budget for the entire year, I need to know exactly what we're looking at before I walk into that boardroom. Is this an architectural failure or just some patches we need to run?",
