      "content": "$5M to $8M?! Are you serious? That is an insane amount of money to drop on a single audit. \n\nLook, I need to be very clear here because my job is on the line. If I go to the board with a figure that high based on a \"concurrency\" issue, they are going to tear me apart unless it's an absolute, non-negotiable catastrophe. Is there ANY chance this is being overstated? Is there any way we can frame this as a \"maintenance optimization\" or a \"planned upgrade\" rather than a critical failure that needs millions in immediate funding? I need to know for sure if there are any actual security breaches possible here, or if this is just a performance bottleneck.",
